It's not something to show to others.

153
00:20:21,093 --> 00:20:26,593
伝えなかった言霊が もうひとつの私になって
Unspoken words became another me,

154
00:20:26,893 --> 00:20:32,893
身体の内側で何かを叫んでいる
shouting something inside my body.

155
00:20:33,093 --> 00:20:38,393
欲しかったのに 悔しかったのに
Though I wanted it so badly, though I felt so much regret...

156
00:20:38,593 --> 00:20:42,893
ダメだよ 全部品隠しておくの
No, you must hide it all away.

157
00:20:43,093 --> 00:20:44,593
ごめんね
I'm sorry.

158
00:20:44,893 --> 00:20:50,893
悲しいのは一人で十分だからと
"Because sadness is enough for just one," you said,

159
00:20:51,093 --> 00:20:57,093
これ以上醜くなりたくないのと
and "I don't want to become any uglier."

160
00:20:57,293 --> 00:21:03,693
私の中で誰にも見つけられずに
Inside of me, unseen by anyone,

161
00:21:03,893 --> 00:21:09,393
こんな色になるまで泣いていたんだね
you were crying until you turned this color, weren't you?

162
00:21:09,593 --> 00:21:13,593
綺麗よ
You are beautiful.

163
00:21:23,093 --> 00:21:30,293
渡しそびれた心から 流れ出た青い雫
From the heart I couldn't ever give, blue drops flowed out.

164
00:21:30,593 --> 00:21:35,593
人様にかぶせるものじゃないの
It's not something to pour onto others.

165
00:21:35,893 --> 00:21:42,893
余すことなく飲み込んで 遠くの海の底に沈んで
Swallowing it all down, sinking to the bottom of a distant sea,

166
00:21:43,093 --> 00:21:48,093
そのまま宝石にでもなれるのを待つわ
I'll wait there, hoping to turn into a jewel.

167
00:22:00,293 --> 00:22:03,093
本当は嘘で飾って
Decorating the truth with lies,

168
00:22:03,293 --> 00:22:07,093
ごっこみたいな暮らしで慰めて
comforting myself with a life like make-believe,

169
00:22:07,293 --> 00:22:12,593
誰かの悲劇で自分の悲劇を癒して
healing my own tragedy with someone else's pain,

170
00:22:12,893 --> 00:22:18,693
恋しさに溺れた瞬間のままで
in that moment I drowned in yearning,

171
00:22:18,893 --> 00:22:25,093
息も出来ずただ愛してるの
unable to even breathe, I just love you.

172
00:22:25,393 --> 00:22:31,393
悲しいのは一人で十分だからと
"Because sadness is enough for just one," you said,

173
00:22:31,593 --> 00:22:37,393
これ以上醜くなりたくないのと
and "I don't want to become any uglier."

174
00:22:37,593 --> 00:22:44,093
私の中で誰にも見つけられずに
Inside of me, unseen by anyone,

175
00:22:44,293 --> 00:22:49,893
こんな色になるまで泣いていたんだね
you were crying until you turned this color, weren't you?

176
00:22:50,093 --> 00:22:53,593
綺麗よ
You are beautiful.

177
00:22:56,893 --> 00:22:59,093
ごめんね
I'm sorry.

178
00:23:01,893 --> 00:23:05,593
ねぇ 綺麗よ
Hey... you are beautiful.

179
00:23:48,893 --> 00:23:55,093
片っぽで丸を作って しっかり持ってて
Make a loop with one end, and hold it tight.

180
00:23:55,393 --> 00:24:01,893
もう片っぽでその丸の後ろをぐるっと回って
With the other end, wrap around the back of that loop.

181
00:24:02,093 --> 00:24:08,093
間にできたポッケに入って 出てくるの待ってて
Pass through the pocket created between, and wait for it to come out.

182
00:24:08,293 --> 00:24:15,293
出てきたところを迎えに来て “せーの”で引っ張って
Catch it as it emerges, and pull together on "Ready, set..."

183
00:24:16,093 --> 00:24:22,593
初めは何とも情けない形だとしても
Even if it looks somewhat clumsy at first,

184
00:24:22,893 --> 00:24:31,293
同じだけ力をこめて
put equal strength into it.

185
00:24:32,593 --> 00:24:38,393
羽根は大きく 結び目は硬く
Wings large, knot tight,

186
00:24:38,593 --> 00:24:46,293
なるようにきつく結んでいてほしいの
I want you to tie it tightly so it stays.

187
00:24:46,593 --> 00:24:52,593
手はここに 思い出は遠くに
Hands here, memories far away,

188
00:24:52,593 --> 00:24:59,893
置いて おいて ほしい ほしいの
I want you to leave them... leave them there.

189
00:25:10,319 --> 00:25:16,019
片っぽでも引っ張っちゃえば ほどけちゃうけど
If you pull on just one end, it will come undone,

190
00:25:16,619 --> 00:25:22,319
作ったもの壊すのは 遥かに簡単だけど
though destroying something you've made is far easier.

191
00:25:22,819 --> 00:25:29,319
だけどほどく時も そうちゃんと同じようにね
But even when untying it, do it just the same way.

192
00:25:29,819 --> 00:25:36,719
分かってるよ でもできたらね 「せーの」で引っ張って
I know, but if you can, pull it on the count of "one, two."

193
00:25:37,319 --> 00:25:43,619
ほどけやしないようにと 願って力込めては
Wishing it won't come undone, as I put strength into it,

194
00:25:43,819 --> 00:25:52,619
広げすぎた羽に戸惑う
I'm bewildered by the wings I spread too wide.

195
00:25:53,319 --> 00:26:00,019
羽根は大きく 結び目は強く
So that the wings are large and the knot is firm,

196
00:26:00,319 --> 00:26:07,019
なるようにきつく 結んでいてほしいの
I want you to tie it tightly like that.

197
00:26:07,319 --> 00:26:14,019
夢はここに 思い出は遠くに
Your dreams here and your memories far away,

198
00:26:14,319 --> 00:26:21,319
気づけばそこにあるくらいがいい
it's good enough if they're right there when you notice.

199
00:26:23,819 --> 00:26:30,319
黙って引っ張ったりしないでよ
Don't just pull silently,

200
00:26:30,819 --> 00:26:37,819
結んだつもりがほどいていたり 緩めたつもりが締めていたり
thinking you tied it when you untied it, thinking you loosened it when you tightened it.

201
00:27:02,819 --> 00:27:09,319
この蒼くて広い世界に 無数に散らばった中から
From among the countless threads scattered in this blue and wide world,

202
00:27:09,819 --> 00:27:16,319
別々に出会った二人 選んだ糸を お互いたぐり寄せ合ったんだ
we each chose our own thread and pulled them closer to each other.

203
00:27:16,819 --> 00:27:23,319
結ばれたんじゃない 結んだんだ 二人で「せーの」で引っ張ったんだ
We didn't just get tied, we tied it ourselves; the two of us pulled it on the count of "one, two."

204
00:27:23,819 --> 00:27:30,319
大きくも小さくもなりすぎないように 力を込めたんだ
We put our strength into it so it wouldn't become too big or too small.

205
00:27:30,819 --> 00:27:37,319
この蒼くて広い世界に 無数に散らばった中から
From among the countless threads scattered in this blue and wide world,

206
00:27:37,819 --> 00:27:43,319
別々に出会った二人 選んだ糸を お互いたぐり寄せ合ったんだ
we each chose our own thread and pulled them closer to each other.

207
00:27:43,819 --> 00:27:50,319
結ばれたんじゃない 結んだんだ 二人で「せーの」で引っ張ったんだ
We didn't just get tied, we tied it ourselves; the two of us pulled it on the count of "one, two."

208
00:27:50,819 --> 00:27:57,619
大きくも小さくもなりすぎないように 力を込めたんだ
We put our strength into it so it wouldn't become too big or too small.

209
00:28:47,819 --> 00:28:51,819
花になって
[Song: Become a Flower]

210
00:28:58,319 --> 00:29:02,619
陰にそっと隠れようが良いんじゃない？
It's okay to quietly hide in the shadows, isn't it?

211
00:29:02,819 --> 00:29:07,319
蕾のような花だってあるんじゃない？
Aren't there flowers like buds?

212
00:29:07,819 --> 00:29:12,319
秘密にして守るのがいいんじゃない？
Isn't it good to keep it a secret and protect it?

213
00:29:12,819 --> 00:29:17,619
誰にも邪魔されず華麗に咲いてる
Blooming brilliantly without being disturbed by anyone.

214
00:29:18,319 --> 00:29:20,319
甘い苦いにハマんない
Not getting caught up in sweet or bitter,

215
00:29:20,819 --> 00:29:23,019
その判断がくだんない
that judgment is worthless.

216
00:29:23,319 --> 00:29:27,619
気に病んで下を向かないでいて
Don't look down worrying about it.

217
00:29:28,319 --> 00:29:30,319
愛に慣れちゃいない
Not used to love,

218
00:29:30,819 --> 00:29:32,619
無駄に飾らない
without unnecessary decoration.

219
00:29:32,819 --> 00:29:35,619
綺麗にされた花瓶も
Neither a beautifully arranged vase,

220
00:29:35,819 --> 00:29:37,619
肥やしも何もしらない
nor any fertilizer is needed.

221
00:29:38,319 --> 00:29:41,619
その姿が美しい
That appearance is beautiful.

222
00:29:42,319 --> 00:29:45,019
花になって
Become a flower,

223
00:29:45,319 --> 00:29:48,319
ほらニヒルに笑って
hey, smile cynically.

224
00:29:48,619 --> 00:29:52,819
その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない
I can't take my eyes off your face, getting thrills from it.

225
00:29:53,319 --> 00:29:55,319
味見して
Tasting it,

226
00:29:55,619 --> 00:30:00,464
君の毒は私の薬って
your poison is my medicine.

227
00:30:01,264 --> 00:30:03,264
笑って
Smile

228
00:30:07,564 --> 00:30:11,264
逢いたい 逢いたい その笑顔に
I want to see, I want to see that smile

229
00:30:11,264 --> 00:30:17,964
逢いたい 逢いたいって言えば笑ってくれるかな
If I say I want to see you, will you smile for me?

230
00:30:18,264 --> 00:30:22,664
陰から支えるくらいはいいんじゃない？
Isn't it fine to just support you from the shadows?

231
00:30:22,664 --> 00:30:27,964
欲を言えばこの手で咲かせてみたい
If I'm being greedy, I want to make you bloom with these hands

232
00:30:27,964 --> 00:30:30,264
病のように
Like a disease,

233
00:30:30,264 --> 00:30:40,264
心は喰らう花 枯らしたくないのさ
a flower eating away at the heart, I don't want it to wither

234
00:30:40,464 --> 00:30:45,464
光が届かずとも
Even if the light doesn't reach,

235
00:30:45,464 --> 00:30:51,464
水をあげ続けるから
I'll keep giving you water.

236
00:30:52,964 --> 00:30:58,464
いい加減に気づいて 君は素敵って
Realize it already, that you're wonderful.

237
00:30:58,464 --> 00:31:02,964
うぬぼれてもっとお大事に
Be conceited and take better care of yourself.

238
00:31:02,964 --> 00:31:08,464
無自覚なまんま 愛を蓄えて
Store up love without even realizing it.

239
00:31:08,464 --> 00:31:10,664
綺麗にされた花瓶も
A beautifully arranged vase,

240
00:31:10,664 --> 00:31:13,264
肥やしも何もいらない
or fertilizer, you don't need any of it.

241
00:31:13,264 --> 00:31:18,464
その姿で咲き誇れ
Bloom proudly just as you are.

242
00:31:18,964 --> 00:31:22,264
花になって
Become a flower,

243
00:31:22,264 --> 00:31:24,464
ほらニヒルに笑って
come on, smile nihilistically.

244
00:31:24,464 --> 00:31:29,264
その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない
I get thrills from that face and can't look away.

245
00:31:29,264 --> 00:31:31,664
味見して
Take a taste,

246
00:31:31,664 --> 00:31:36,264
君の毒は私の薬って
saying your poison is my medicine.

247
00:31:36,264 --> 00:31:39,664
包んであげるから
I'll wrap you up,

248
00:31:39,664 --> 00:31:42,264
楽にして
make yourself comfortable,

249
00:31:42,264 --> 00:31:46,464
君の闇は私の光って
saying your darkness is my light.

250
00:31:46,464 --> 00:31:48,964
愛してあげるから
I'll love you,

251
00:31:48,964 --> 00:31:50,964
笑って
so smile.

252
00:32:13,464 --> 00:32:16,464
ドライフラワー
[Dry Flower]

253
00:32:23,264 --> 00:32:27,464
多分、私じゃなくて良くて
Maybe I wasn't the right one for you,

254
00:32:27,464 --> 00:32:30,464
余裕のない二人だったし
we both lacked composure.

255
00:32:30,464 --> 00:32:35,464
気付けば喧嘩ばっかりしてさ ごめんね
Before we knew it, we were always fighting, I'm sorry.

256
00:32:35,464 --> 00:32:39,264
ずっと話そうと思ってた
I'd been thinking about talking to you for so long.

257
00:32:39,264 --> 00:32:42,664
きっと私たち合わないね
We really aren't right for each other.

258
00:32:42,664 --> 00:32:45,464
二人きりしかない部屋でさ
In that room with just the two of us,

259
00:32:45,464 --> 00:32:48,964
あなたばかり話していたよね
you were always the one doing all the talking.

260
00:32:48,964 --> 00:32:54,464
もしいつか何処かで逢えたら
If we ever run into each other somewhere,

261
00:32:54,464 --> 00:33:01,264
今日の事を笑ってくれるかな
wonder if you'll be able to laugh about today.

262
00:33:01,264 --> 00:33:07,464
理由もしっかり話せないけれど
Even though I can't really explain the reason well,

263
00:33:07,464 --> 00:33:14,964
あなたが眠った後に脱ぐのは上着
taking off my jacket after you fall asleep.

264
00:33:14,964 --> 00:33:21,464
声も顔も不器用なとこも
Your voice, your face, even your clumsiness,

265
00:33:21,464 --> 00:33:26,964
全部全部 嫌いじゃないの
all of it, all of it, I don't hate.

266
00:33:26,964 --> 00:33:31,464
ドライフラワーみたい
Like dried flowers,

267
00:33:31,464 --> 00:33:34,264
君との日々も
our days together too,

268
00:33:34,264 --> 00:33:38,264
きっときっときっときっと
surely, surely, surely, surely,

269
00:33:38,264 --> 00:33:42,964
色褪せる
will fade away.

270
00:33:57,264 --> 00:34:01,264
多分 君じゃなくてよかった
Maybe it's good it wasn't you,

271
00:34:01,264 --> 00:34:04,264
もう泣かされることもないし
I won't be made to cry anymore.

272
00:34:04,264 --> 00:34:09,964
「私ばかり」なんて言葉もなくなった
And phrases like 'It's always me' are gone now too.

273
00:34:09,964 --> 00:34:13,664
あんなに悲しいお別れでも
Even after such a sad farewell,

274
00:34:13,664 --> 00:34:16,664
時間がたてば忘れてく
as time passes, I start to forget.

275
00:34:16,664 --> 00:34:19,664
新しい人と並ぶ君は
Standing beside someone new, I wonder,

276
00:34:19,664 --> 00:34:23,664
ちゃんとうまくやれているのかな
are you doing well with them?

277
00:34:23,664 --> 00:34:27,964
もう顔も見たくないからさ
I don't even want to see your face anymore,

278
00:34:27,964 --> 00:34:34,964
変に連絡してこないでほしい
so please don't contact me out of nowhere.

279
00:34:34,964 --> 00:34:41,664
都合がいいのは変わってないんだね
You being self-serving hasn't changed at all,

280
00:34:41,664 --> 00:34:48,964
でも無視できずにまた少し返事
yet unable to ignore it, I reply a little again.

281
00:34:48,964 --> 00:34:55,264
声も顔も不器用なとこも
Your voice, your face, even your clumsiness,

282
00:34:55,264 --> 00:35:00,964
多分 今も 嫌いじゃないの
maybe even now, I don't hate them.

283
00:35:01,958 --> 00:35:04,258
みたく
Like...

284
00:35:04,458 --> 00:35:07,458
時間が経てば
As time passes,

285
00:35:07,658 --> 00:35:12,458
きっと きっと きっと きっと
surely, surely, surely, surely,

286
00:35:12,458 --> 00:35:18,758
色褪せる
they will fade.

287
00:35:27,958 --> 00:35:32,158
月明かりには魔物が揺れる
Monsters sway in the moonlight.

288
00:35:32,158 --> 00:35:35,358
きっと私もどうかしてる
I must be going crazy, too.

289
00:35:35,358 --> 00:35:40,758
暗闇に色彩が浮かぶ
Colors float in the darkness.

290
00:35:40,958 --> 00:35:44,458
赤黄藍色が胸の奥
Red, yellow, and blue deep inside my chest,

291
00:35:44,458 --> 00:35:47,958
ずっとあなたの名前を呼ぶ
always calling out your name.

292
00:35:47,958 --> 00:35:53,458
好きという気持ち また香る
The feeling of love scents the air once more.

293
00:35:53,458 --> 00:36:01,758
声も顔も不器用なことも
Your voice, your face, even your clumsiness...

294
00:36:01,758 --> 00:36:06,458
全部全部 大嫌いだよ
All of it, all of it, I hate so much.

295
00:36:06,458 --> 00:36:10,458
まだ枯れない花を
These flowers that have yet to wither,

296
00:36:10,458 --> 00:36:13,758
君に添えてさ
I offer them to you,

297
00:36:13,758 --> 00:36:17,758
ずっと ずっと ずっと ずっと
forever, forever, forever, forever,

298
00:36:17,758 --> 00:36:22,958
抱えてよ
hold on to them.

299
00:37:11,958 --> 00:37:16,958
二人三脚 feat. 描汰つな
[Three-Legged Race feat. Nekota Tsuna]

300
00:37:17,758 --> 00:37:23,958
「大丈夫」と
"I'm okay,"

301
00:37:24,158 --> 00:37:30,458
また嘘をついた
I lied once again.

302
00:37:30,758 --> 00:37:35,158
「無理しているの」
"You're overexerting yourself,"

303
00:37:35,158 --> 00:37:37,958
声でわかるよ
I can tell by your voice.

304
00:37:38,158 --> 00:37:41,758
バレているんだよ
I see right through you.

305
00:37:50,758 --> 00:37:56,758
見ためだとか 性格だって 違うあなた
You, who are so different in looks and personality,

306
00:37:56,958 --> 00:38:02,758
だけど似てる どこか意外とあって
yet we're surprisingly alike in some ways.

307
00:38:02,958 --> 00:38:05,958
共鳴 すぐにしたんだ
We resonated right away,

308
00:38:06,158 --> 00:38:09,958
惹かれ合った私たち
drawn to each other.

309
00:38:10,158 --> 00:38:13,158
不思議なこの絆
This mysterious bond...

310
00:38:13,158 --> 00:38:15,758
なんだか重ねられなくて
Somehow we couldn't align,

311
00:38:15,758 --> 00:38:16,958
向き合い
facing each other,

312
00:38:16,958 --> 00:38:19,158
目を語り合おう
let's speak with our eyes.

313
00:38:19,158 --> 00:38:22,958
私がいね 頑張れる理由
The reason why I can do my best:

314
00:38:22,958 --> 00:38:29,458
そう 一人じゃないから
Yes, because I'm not alone.

315
00:38:29,458 --> 00:38:32,758
あなたが笑えば
When you smile,

316
00:38:32,758 --> 00:38:35,458
私もつられる
I smile along with you.

317
00:38:35,458 --> 00:38:41,958
隣合わせの心 連鎖してるよ
Our side-by-side hearts are linked together.

318
00:38:41,958 --> 00:38:47,458
時には歩幅が ズレてしまうけど
Even if our strides get out of sync at times,

319
00:38:47,458 --> 00:38:57,458
二人 呼吸を合わせ さあ 未来へ進んで行こう
breathing as one, let us move forward to the future.

320
00:38:57,458 --> 00:39:03,458
どれくらいの順位かな 周りと比べて
I wonder where we rank, comparing ourselves to others.

321
00:39:03,458 --> 00:39:09,458
果てしないトラック戦 追いつけるの？
Can we catch up in this endless track race?

322
00:39:09,458 --> 00:39:15,758
なんて弱気な日も 激励し続けてくれた
Even on weak-hearted days, you kept encouraging me.

323
00:39:15,758 --> 00:39:19,958
あなたにいつも感謝
I'm always grateful to you.

324
00:39:19,958 --> 00:39:22,758
転んでも立ち上がる
Even if we fall, we get back up,

